#: install.php:346
msgid ""
"The \"canceldispositionenabled\" option in Asterisk configures Call Detail "
"Records (CDR) to distinguish calls that were cancelled (abandoned by the "
"caller before being answered) from other unanswered calls. When this option "
"is enabled, calls ending due to the caller hanging up during ringing will "
"have the disposition \"CANCEL\" instead of the default \"NO ANSWER\". This "
"option is supported on Asterisk version 20 and above."
msgstr ""
"Asterisk 中的 \"canceldispositionenabled\" 選項可讓 CDR 區分已取消（撥叫者在接聽前掛斷）與其他未接通的通話。啟用此選項後，因撥叫者在響鈴期間掛斷而結束的通話，其接通狀態將為 \"CANCEL\" 而非預設的 \"NO ANSWER\"。此選項支援 Asterisk 20 及以上版本。"

#: cdr.i18n.php:32
msgid ""
"The CDR engine uses the internal asterisk scheduler to determine when to "
"post records. Posting can either occur inside the scheduler thread, or a new "
"thread can be spawned for the submission of every batch. For small batches, "
"it might be acceptable to just use the scheduler thread, so set this to "
msgstr ""
"CDR 引擎使用內部 Asterisk 排程器來決定何時傳送記錄。傳送可在排程器執行緒內完成，或可為每次批次送出產生新執行緒。對於小型批次，使用排程器執行緒可能已可接受，因此請將此設為 "

